vatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/1295820.png\",\"name\":\"ClV_Csy\",\"slogan\":\"CSP-S 2026 RP++;  \\/\\/\\u4e0d\\u62ff\\u84dd\\u94a9\\u4e0d\\u6539\\u7b7e\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Orange\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/lwcs50fn.png\"},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1012\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\",\"difficulty\":4,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"# P1012 [NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\\n## \\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5229\\u7528 `sort` \\u6392\\u5e8f\\u6765\\u5b8c\\u6210\\u6b64\\u9898\\u3002\\u5b9a\\u4e49\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u51fd\\u6570 `cmp(string a, string b)`\\uff0c\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u503c\\u4e3a `a + b \\u003E b + a`\\u3002\\n## \\u8bc1\\u660e\\n\\u5047\\u8bbe\\u6709\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u8868\\u793a\\u7684\\u6570 $a$ \\u548c $b$\\uff0c\\u8981\\u5982\\u4f55\\u6765\\u62fc\\u63a5\\u4f7f\\u5f97\\u62fc\\u63a5\\u7ed3\\u679c\\u6700\\u5927\\u5462\\uff1f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5c1d\\u8bd5\\u6bd4\\u8f83 $a + b$ \\u4e0e $b + a$ \\u7684\\u5927\\u5c0f\\uff08\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff1a\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u7684\\u52a0\\u6cd5\\u6307\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u62fc\\u63a5\\uff0c\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u6307\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u7684\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f\\u5927\\u5c0f\\uff09\\u3002\\u5982\\u679c $a + b \\u003E b + a$\\uff0c\\u90a3\\u4e48\\u6700\\u4f18\\u65b9\\u6848\\u5f53\\u7136\\u662f $a + b$\\uff0c\\u5426\\u5219\\u6700\\u4f18\\u65b9\\u6848\\u5219\\u4e3a $b + a$\\u3002\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u7ed3\\u8bba\\u4e5f\\u5f88\\u5bb9\\u6613\\u63a8\\u5e7f\\u5230\\u66f4\\u591a\\u6570\\u91cf\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u62fc\\u63a5\\u3002\\n## \\u4ee3\\u7801\\n**\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff1a**  \\n\\u8981\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u81ea\\u5e26\\u7684 `sort` \\u51fd\\u6570\\uff0c\\u4e0d\\u8981\\u5fd8\\u8bb0\\u5305\\u542b `algorithm` \\u5934\\u6587\\u4ef6\\u3002\\n```cpp\\n#include \\u003Ciostream\\u003E\\n#include \\u003Calgorithm\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nbool cmp(string a, string b) {\\n\\treturn a + b \\u003E b + a;\\n}\\nint main() {\\n\\tint n;\\n\\tstring a[21];\\n\\tcin \\u003E\\u003E n;\\n\\tfor (int i = 1; i \\u003C= n; i++)\\n\\t\\tcin \\u003E\\u003E a[i];\\n\\tsort(a + 1, a + n + 1, cmp);\\n\\tfor (int i = 1; i \\u003C= n; i++)\\n\\t\\tcout \\u003C\\u003C a[i];\\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\\n```\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593080.434042}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/kckry124\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1012 [NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\",\"description\":\"P1012 [NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\\n\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5229\\u7528 sort \\u6392\\u5e8f\\u6765\\u5b8c\\u6210\\u6b64\\u9898\\u3002\\u5b9a\\u4e49\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u51fd\\u6570 cmp(string a, string b)\\uff0c\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u503c\\u4e3a a + b &gt; b + a\\u3002\\n\\u8bc1\\u660e\\n\\u5047\\u8bbe\\u6709\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u8868\\u793a\\u7684\\u6570 a\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ClV_Csy\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-02-07T16:58:27+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数\n思路\n我们可以利用 sort 排序来完成此题。定义排序函数 cmp(string a, string b)，返回值为 a + b &amp;gt; b + a。\n证明\n假设有两个字符串表示的数 a…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"ClV_Csy\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-02-07T16:58:27+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/kckry124\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">ClV_Csy</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-02-07T16:58:27+08:00\">2025-02-07 16:58:27</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h1>P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数</h1>\n<h2>思路</h2>\n<p>我们可以利用 <code>sort</code> 排序来完成此题。定义排序函数 <code>cmp(string a, string b)</code>，返回值为 <code>a + b &gt; b + a</code>。</p>\n<h2>证明</h2>\n<p>假设有两个字符串表示的数 <la-tex display=\"inline\">a</la-tex> 和 <la-tex display=\"inline\">b</la-tex>，要如何来拼接使得拼接结果最大呢？可以尝试比较 <la-tex display=\"inline\">a + b</la-tex> 与 <la-tex display=\"inline\">b + a</la-tex> 的大小（注意：这里的加法指字符串拼接，大小指字符串的字典序大小）。如果 <la-tex display=\"inline\">a + b &gt; b + a</la-tex>，那么最优方案当然是 <la-tex display=\"inline\">a + b</la-tex>，否则最优方案则为 <la-tex display=\"inline\">b + a</la-tex>。这个结论也很容易推广到更多数量的字符串拼接。</p>\n<h2>代码</h2>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong><br />\n要使用自带的 <code>sort</code> 函数，不要忘记包含 <code>algorithm</code> 头文件。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n#include &lt;algorithm&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nbool cmp(string a, string b) {\n    return a + b &gt; b + a;\n}\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    string a[21];\n    cin &gt;&gt; n;\n    for (int i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++)\n        cin &gt;&gt; a[i];\n    sort(a + 1, a + n + 1, cmp);\n    for (int i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++)\n        cout &lt;&lt; a[i];\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff114fcc88d9ed',t:'MTc5NTU5MzA4MA=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff114fcc88d9ed',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
